Attachments

1. Current Week Performance Summary

2. Accumulated Performance Summary

3. Details by lane

4. Performance by Commodity

5. Backhaul top 20 Customer Weekly Performance

6. KPI Backhaul Target/Performance Summary

7. CCB Customer Report


Thanks & B.regards,

